@startuml Data-Flow
!theme plain
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2

title CMS - Przepływ Danych (Data Flow)

actor "Użytkownik" as User
participant "Browser\n(Public-Site)" as Browser
participant "React App" as App
participant "Backend API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
collections "File Storage\n(/uploads)" as Storage

== Inicjalizacja Aplikacji ==

User -> Browser: Odwiedza stronę
Browser -> App: Ładowanie React
App -> API: GET /site/settings
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM site_settings
DB --> API: Settings data
API --> App: { general, header, footer, contact, social_media }

App -> API: GET /site/menus/:header_menu_id
API -> DB: SELECT menu + menu_items
DB --> API: Menu with items
API --> App: Header menu

App -> API: GET /site/menus/:footer_menu_id
API -> DB: SELECT menu + menu_items
DB --> API: Menu with items
API --> App: Footer menu

== Ładowanie Strony Głównej ==

User -> App: Nawigacja do /
App -> API: GET /site/contents/home/full
API -> DB: SELECT content\nWHERE slug='home'
DB --> API: Content
API -> DB: SELECT page_components\nWHERE content_id=?
DB --> API: Components
API -> DB: SELECT content_sections\nWHERE content_id=?
DB --> API: Sections
API --> App: { content, components, sections }

App -> App: extractMediaIds(components)
loop Dla każdego media_id
  App -> API: GET /site/media/:id
  API -> DB: SELECT * FROM media
  DB --> API: Media info
  API --> App: { storage_path, alt_text, ... }
end

App -> App: buildMediaCache()
App -> Browser: Render components\nz obrazami z cache

User -> Browser: Widzi stronę z obrazami
Browser -> Storage: GET /uploads/media/xxx.jpg
Storage --> Browser: Image file

== Ładowanie Podstrony ==

User -> App: Klik w menu\n(np. /o-nas)
App -> API: GET /site/contents/o-nas/full
API -> DB: SELECT content + sections + components
DB --> API: Full content data
API --> App: Content response

App -> App: fetchMediaForSections()
App -> Browser: Render page

== Wysyłanie Formularza Kontaktowego ==

User -> App: Wypełnia formularz
App -> API: POST /site/contact\n{ name, email, message }
API -> API: Validate data
API -> API: Send email notification
API --> App: { success: true }
App -> Browser: Pokazuje potwierdzenie

@enduml
